The Fox and the Persimmons — asset sources & licences

Story       Aesop's fable of the fox and the grapes (public domain), moved to an autumn hill in old Japan (persimmons instead of grapes) and retold in original words.
Artwork     Drawn procedurally in code (print.js, nature.js, views.js). Original compositions.
            Print engine and nature motifs adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT License.
Song        Original lyrics (song/lyrics.json); sung and arranged with Suno (clip id in song/clip.json).
Sound FX    Synthesized in code (mix.py + core/audio/sfx.py). No recordings.
Voice       Kokoro TTS v1.0 (kokoro-onnx), Apache-2.0 — voice bm_george (picture clock only, not audible in the sung version).
Fonts       Shippori Mincho (FONTDASU), Yuji Syuku (Kinuta Font Factory) — Google Fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (subsets in fonts/).
